.TH EZDXF\-VIEW "1" "May 2024" "" "User Commands"
.B ezdxf\ view
PyQt DXF file viewer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ezdxf\ view
.RB [ \-h ]
.RB [ \-l\ \fILAYOUT ]
.RB [ \-\-lwscale\ \fILWSCALE ]
.RI [ FILE ]
.SH OPTIONS
.SS "POSITIONAL\ ARGUMENTS"
.TP
.I FILE
DXF file to view
.SS "OPTIONAL\ ARGUMENTS"
.TP
.B \-h\fR,\ \fB\-\-help
show a help message and exit
.TP
.B \-l\ \fILAYOUT\fR, \fB\-\-layout\ \fILAYOUT
select the layout to draw, default is
.BR \(lq Model \(rq
.TP
.B \-\-lwscale\ \fILWSCALE
set custom line weight scaling, default is
.B 0
to disable line weights at all
.SH ENVIRONMENT
See
.BR ezdxf (1).
.SH FILES
See
.BR ezdxf (1).
.SH EXAMPLES
.P
View the DXF file
.RB \(lq gear.dxf \(rq
by the
.I PyQt
backend:
.P
.in +7n
.EX
.B $\ ezdxf\ view\ \ gear.dxf
.EE
.in
.SH "SEE\ ALSO"
.BR ezdxf (1)
.P
